{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深受大家喜愛的 52TOYS 「小幽靈」，重磅推出全新第二彈「好朋狗系列」！今次小幽靈擺脫孤單，與各式各樣超萌的小狗朋友驚喜組合，全系列一共包含9款常規款加上1款隱藏款，將幽靈的俏皮奇幻與狗狗的忠誠治癒完美結合！每一款都將小幽靈標誌性的半透明質感與狗狗的可愛表情發揮得淋漓盡致。今次加入了「夜光效果」設計！只要在關燈或暗處，小幽靈就會散發出淡淡的夢幻光芒，充滿萬聖節氣氛！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225282359712157_11150281506ad39b97da8b4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225282541124281_13586782956ad39b99bbf08.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225282734981155_18716646886ad39b9b961fd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225282881162978_18590848396ad39b9d17585.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225283025123822_17876879646ad39b9f9194e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17922528335785709_17254427746ad39ba1d035b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179225283504058927_600397806ad39ba358c9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T16:18:59.670507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T01:57:44.651545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T16:17:35.042189+00:00","content_hash":"b1e3fb6b4d9ffd2036def43ddc1bc2540ac53785120c81d115709be9ca6f1dbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}